title: Panzerkreuzer B
subtitle: A political question
tags: event
on-arrival: panzerkreuzer_b_seen = 1
new-page: true
face-image: img/panzerkreuzer.jpg
view-if: panzerkreuzer_b_seen = 0 and year = 1931 and month >= 2 and (spd_in_government = 1 or spd_toleration = 1)

= Panzerkreuzer B

The Navy is demanding the construction of another new battlecruiser. [? if panzerkreuzer_funded: The previous battlecruiser had been funded, and has already been launched. Another ship would futher progress Germany's rearmament. ?][? if not panzerkreuzer_funded: The previous battlecruiser requested by the Navy was not funded, thanks to us. The military remains bitter, but nevertheless they are still pursuing their rearmament plan, and must seek funding from the Reichstag. ?]

Much of our party is deeply opposed to rearmament, while the center and right parties are united in support. What will we do?

- @vote_yes: Vote yes, for constructing the battlecruiser.
- @vote_no: Vote no, against constructing the battlecruiser.
- @abstain: Abstain from the vote.
- @ministry: Use the Reichswehr Ministry to prevent the construction.

@vote_yes
on-arrival: left_dissent += 10; labor_dissent += 5; center_dissent += 5; reformist_dissent += 5 if not panzerkreuzer_funded; neorevisionist_dissent += 5 if not panzerkreuzer_funded; panzerkreuzer_b_funded = 1; kpd_coalition_dissent += 1; kpd_relation -= 6; workers_spd -= 4; spd_pkb_vote = "yes"
go-to: calc_panzerkreuzer_b

@vote_no
on-arrival: dvp_relation -= 8; z_relation -= 5; pacifism += 1; nationalism -= 5*(1-dissent); workers_spd += 4*(1-dissent) if nationalism < 49; spd_pkb_vote = "no"
go-to: calc_panzerkreuzer_b

@abstain
on-arrival: dvp_relation -= 5; z_relation -= 3; left_dissent += 5; labor_dissent += 5 if not panzerkreuzer_funded; kpd_relation -= 3; spd_pkb_vote = "abstain"
go-to: calc_panzerkreuzer_b

@ministry
on-arrival: panzerkreuzer_b_funded = 0; budget += 1 if panzerkreuzer_funded = 0
view-if: reichswehr_minister_party == "SPD"

With our control of the Reichswehr Ministry, we have pressured the Navy to abandon its rearmament plans. The ship will not be built. [? if panzerkreuzer_funded == 0 : We have saved some budget from not funding the two ships. ?]

@calc_panzerkreuzer_b
on-arrival: {!
Q.panzerkreuzer_b_yes = 0;
Q.panzerkreuzer_b_no = 0;
Q.panzerkreuzer_b_abstain = 0;

Q.panzerkreuzer_b_yes_parties = [];
Q.panzerkreuzer_b_no_parties = [];
Q.panzerkreuzer_b_abstain_parties = [];

for (var i = 0; i < Q.parties.length; i++) {
    var party = Q.parties[i];

    if (party === "spd") {
        Q[party + "_pkb_vote"] = Q.spd_pkb_vote;
    } else {
        var score = Q[party + "_ideo_score"];
        Q[party + "_pkb_vote"] = (score !== undefined && score <= 9) ? "no" : "yes";
    }

    var seats = Q[party + "_r"] || 0;
    var label = Q.PARTY_DISPLAY_NAMES && Q.PARTY_DISPLAY_NAMES[party]
        ? Q.PARTY_DISPLAY_NAMES[party].replace(/^The /, "")
        : party.toUpperCase();

    if (Q[party + "_pkb_vote"] === "yes") {
        Q.panzerkreuzer_b_yes += seats;
        Q.panzerkreuzer_b_yes_parties.push(label);
    } else if (Q[party + "_pkb_vote"] === "no") {
        Q.panzerkreuzer_b_no += seats;
        Q.panzerkreuzer_b_no_parties.push(label);
    } else {
        Q.panzerkreuzer_b_abstain += seats;
        Q.panzerkreuzer_b_abstain_parties.push(label);
    }
}

Q.panzerkreuzer_b_yes = Math.round(Q.panzerkreuzer_b_yes * 10) / 10;
Q.panzerkreuzer_b_no = Math.round(Q.panzerkreuzer_b_no * 10) / 10;
Q.panzerkreuzer_b_abstain = Math.round(Q.panzerkreuzer_b_abstain * 10) / 10;

var voting_total = Q.panzerkreuzer_b_yes + Q.panzerkreuzer_b_no;
Q.panzerkreuzer_b_yes_share = voting_total > 0 ? Math.round((Q.panzerkreuzer_b_yes / voting_total) * 1000) / 10 : 0;
Q.panzerkreuzer_b_no_share = voting_total > 0 ? Math.round((Q.panzerkreuzer_b_no / voting_total) * 1000) / 10 : 0;

Q.panzerkreuzer_b_result = (Q.panzerkreuzer_b_yes > Q.panzerkreuzer_b_no) ? "pass" : "fail";

Q.panzerkreuzer_b_yes_list = Q.panzerkreuzer_b_yes_parties.length > 0 ? Q.panzerkreuzer_b_yes_parties.join(", ") : "none";
Q.panzerkreuzer_b_no_list = Q.panzerkreuzer_b_no_parties.length > 0 ? Q.panzerkreuzer_b_no_parties.join(", ") : "none";
Q.panzerkreuzer_b_abstain_list = Q.panzerkreuzer_b_abstain_parties.length > 0 ? Q.panzerkreuzer_b_abstain_parties.join(", ") : "none";
!}
go-to: built if spd_pkb_vote = "yes" or spd_pkb_vote = "abstain"; built if spd_pkb_vote = "no" and panzerkreuzer_b_result = "pass"; not_built if spd_pkb_vote = "no" and panzerkreuzer_b_result = "fail"

@built
on-arrival: panzerkreuzer_b_funded = 1

The votes are tallied in the Reichstag.

**For** ([+ panzerkreuzer_b_yes +] seats, [+ panzerkreuzer_b_yes_share +]%): [+ panzerkreuzer_b_yes_list +]
**Against** ([+ panzerkreuzer_b_no +] seats, [+ panzerkreuzer_b_no_share +]%): [+ panzerkreuzer_b_no_list +]
**Abstaining** ([+ panzerkreuzer_b_abstain +] seats): [+ panzerkreuzer_b_abstain_list +]

[? if spd_pkb_vote = "yes": The vote in favor of the battlecruiser easily passes, with opposition only from the KPD. The ship will be built. ?]
[? if spd_pkb_vote = "abstain": Despite our abstention, the vote in the Reichstag passes, with all parties in favor except the SPD and KPD. The ship will be built. [? if panzerkreuzer_funded : Given the construction of the previous battlecruiser, this seemed to be a foregone conclusion, and the reaction is muted. ?] ?]
[? if spd_pkb_vote = "no": Our vote against the battlecruiser is unpopular among the right-wing parties[? if in_grand_coalition or in_weimar_coalition: , including our coalition partners ?][? if spd_toleration: , including the minority government that we are currently supporting ?]. Chancellor [+ chancellor +] brings the matter to a full Reichstag vote, which passes with all parties in favor except the SPD and KPD. The ship will be built. ?]

@not_built
on-arrival: panzerkreuzer_b_funded = 0; budget += 1 if panzerkreuzer_funded = 0

The votes are tallied in the Reichstag.

**For** ([+ panzerkreuzer_b_yes +] seats, [+ panzerkreuzer_b_yes_share +]%): [+ panzerkreuzer_b_yes_list +]
**Against** ([+ panzerkreuzer_b_no +] seats, [+ panzerkreuzer_b_no_share +]%): [+ panzerkreuzer_b_no_list +]
**Abstaining** ([+ panzerkreuzer_b_abstain +] seats): [+ panzerkreuzer_b_abstain_list +]

Our vote against the battlecruiser succeeds, with the support of the KPD and anti-war portions of the [+ ddp_name +]. The ship will not be built! [? if panzerkreuzer_funded == 0 : We have saved some budget from not funding the two ships. ?]
